# eukhe: the proofs. Each law of laws/<area>.bend is proven in
# proof/<area>/<law>.bend from the lemmas of its area (proof/<area>/base.bend)
# and of every area (proof/base.bend). `bend PROOF.bend --verdict` checks them all.

